      "returnType": "template<ResourceType> void",
      "docs": "Can store arbitrary data so long as it follows alignment restrictions. Intended mostly for read only data uploaded from CPU.\nAllows sparse allocations and updates from CPU.\nFloat4 versions exist for platforms that don't yet support byte address buffers."
